  "question": {
    "text": "The minimum value of the sum of the squares of the roots of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;is"
  },
